    <briefdescription>
<para>Device-safe view into an nBlocks x nBlocks dense coupling matrix. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents the coupling between field components at a single CSR position (cell pair). Stored in column-major order: operator()(i, j) accesses values[i + j * nBlocks]. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
